{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/b02a06e6aad832f02b5621352c474a3e.poster.avif?t=1762194487\" aria-label=\"Banner animation with moving text, set against a dark night landscape. The text reads &amp;quot;Discovery&amp;quot;.\" width=1600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/b02a06e6aad832f02b5621352c474a3e.webm?t=1762194487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night brings a new enigma: an undeliverable letter. Join the charming Letty as you help her track down these lost messages and unravel their hidden truths: Who penned them? Where are their dead letter boxes? And to whom were they truly addressed? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to leisurely explore the slumbering village of Tsukinoma, discovering its many unique details along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/a241cdcda653701ed2c725bbb02dbb5b.poster.avif?t=1762194487\" aria-label=\"Banner animation with moving text, set against a dark night landscape. The text reads &amp;quot;Relaxation&amp;quot;.\" width=1600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/a241cdcda653701ed2c725bbb02dbb5b.webm?t=1762194487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Savor the solitude of the sleeping night. Drift through the village as its beings sleep, let its soothing melodies guide you and find solace in its calming Zen elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the serene and aesthetically pleasing atmosphere of Tsukinoma past midnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/eece592d23a0a7d5a541cab4ea8cb5c0.poster.avif?t=1762194487\" aria-label=\"Banner animation with moving text, set against a dark night landscape. The text reads &amp;quot;Beauty&amp;quot;.\" width=1600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/eece592d23a0a7d5a541cab4ea8cb5c0.webm?t=1762194487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hand-drawn world of Pencil Stories invites you to leave the everyday behind. Artfully uncover the secrets hidden within each letter, piecing together the fragmented tales of their correspondence. With every discovery, you'll expand Tsukinoma's charming environment a little more each night, unlocking new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Letty with ease via mouse, keyboard, or controller. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she moves, Letty continuously uncovers more world elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unraveling letter mysteries requires diverse approaches:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmask obscured text with magic lights</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear away mud using water</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form patterns and structures with charcoal</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and plenty more to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap-Plan 2025</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Concept\u00a0<i>(May &amp; June)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713  Prototype Village of Tsukinoma <i>(July &amp; August)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Prototype correspondence <i>(August &amp; September)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713  Production Beta <i>(September)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Production Demo <i>(October)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2610 Release <i>(November)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure with us and Letty in <strong>Pencil Stories</strong> today!<br>Got questions or need answers? Dive into the Steam Community and discover more information and updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873450?t=1762194487","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873450?t=1762194487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/572c2100e0b14dd2366089eaa3f2ba8ce0e0b415/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762194487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/572c2100e0b14dd2366089eaa3f2ba8ce0e0b415/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762194487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4091190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873450/extras/b02a06e6aad832f02b5621352c474a3e.poster.avif?t=1762194487\" aria-label=\"Banner animation with moving text, set a